<title>KAZAKHSTAN: KAZAKH TENGE RISES TO 75.7300 TO DLR.</title>
<headline>KAZAKH TENGE RISES TO 75.7300 TO DLR.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.7300 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday after 75.7999 on Friday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Aug 11		  Aug 8</p>
<p> High			     75.7900		 75.8000</p>
<p> Low				75.6000		 75.5500</p>
<p> Open			     75.6000		 75.5500</p>
<p> Close			    75.7300		 75.7999</p>
<p> Volume ($ mln)		  3.715		   2.030</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509 410</p>
